the target language is: prolog.

the functions are:
    the primary person id of the situation is *a text*.
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the simple checks of the situation is *a truth value*.
    the owner occupant of the simple checks of the situation is *a truth value*.
    the tax delinquent of the simple checks of the situation is *a truth value*.
    the apply url of the eligible of the next steps is *a text*.
    the help url of the eligible of the next steps is *a text*.
    the help phone of the eligible of the next steps is *a text*.
    the body of the eligible of the next steps is *a text*.
    the note of the ineligible of the next steps is *a text*.
    the not already on owner occupied payment agreement of the checks is *a value*.
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the checks is *a value*.
    the owner occupant of the checks is *a value*.
    the tax delinquent of the checks is *a value*.
    the is_eligible is *a truth value*.
    the lives in philadelphia pa service result is *a truth value*.
    the owner occupant service result is *a truth value*.
    the tax delinquent service result is *a truth value*.

the templates are:
    the enrollments of the situation include *a person id* with *a benefit*.
    the enrollments of the situation are listed.

the knowledge base owner_occupied_payment_agreement includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/owner-occupied-payment-agreement.dmn".

the apply url of the eligible of the next steps is "https://tax-services.phila.gov/_/".

the help url of the eligible of the next steps is "https://www.phila.gov/services/payments-assistance-taxes/payment-plans-and-assistance-programs/income-based-programs-for-residents/set-up-an-owner-occupied-real-estate-tax-payment-agreement-oopa/".

the help phone of the eligible of the next steps is "(215) 686-6442".

the body of the eligible of the next steps is "Apply through the Philadelphia Tax Center or use the paper application on the program page. You do not need an online account or a down payment to enroll.

- Include proof of income and two forms of proof that you live at the property, including government-issued photo ID.
- Ask for a review of income and expenses if the proposed monthly payment is unaffordable.
- New property taxes may still be due separately. Confirm what your agreement covers.".

the note of the ineligible of the next steps is "You may still qualify if your name is not on the deed but you have a legal ownership interest. Check the program page for the tangled title supplement and supporting documents.".

rule checks_1 with provenance the model at decision checks:
the not already on owner occupied payment agreement of the checks is true if
    the enrollments of the situation are listed
    and the primary person id of the situation is a text
    and it is not the case that
        the enrollments of the situation include a person id with a benefit
        and the primary person id of the situation is the text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the benefit is equal to "PhlOwnerOccupiedPaymentAgreement".

rule checks_2 with provenance the model at decision checks:
the not already on owner occupied payment agreement of the checks is false if
    the enrollments of the situation are listed
    and the enrollments of the situation include a person id with a benefit
    and the person id is equal to the primary person id of the situation
    and the benefit is equal to "PhlOwnerOccupiedPaymentAgreement".

rule lives_in_philadelphia_pa_service_1 with provenance the model at decision LivesInPhiladelphiaPaService:
the lives in philadelphia pa service result is true if
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the simple checks of the situation is true.

rule lives_in_philadelphia_pa_service_2 with provenance the model at decision LivesInPhiladelphiaPaService:
the lives in philadelphia pa service result is false if
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the simple checks of the situation is false.

the lives in philadelphia pa of the checks is the lives in philadelphia pa service result, as stated in the model at decision checks.

rule owner_occupant_service_1 with provenance the model at decision OwnerOccupantService:
the owner occupant service result is true if
    the owner occupant of the simple checks of the situation is true.

rule owner_occupant_service_2 with provenance the model at decision OwnerOccupantService:
the owner occupant service result is false if
    the owner occupant of the simple checks of the situation is false.

the owner occupant of the checks is the owner occupant service result, as stated in the model at decision checks.

rule tax_delinquent_service_1 with provenance the model at decision TaxDelinquentService:
the tax delinquent service result is true if
    the tax delinquent of the simple checks of the situation is true.

rule tax_delinquent_service_2 with provenance the model at decision TaxDelinquentService:
the tax delinquent service result is false if
    the tax delinquent of the simple checks of the situation is false.

the tax delinquent of the checks is the tax delinquent service result, as stated in the model at decision checks.

rule is_eligible_1 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is true if
    the not already on owner occupied payment agreement of the checks is true
    and the lives in philadelphia pa of the checks is true
    and the owner occupant of the checks is true
    and the tax delinquent of the checks is true.

rule is_eligible_2 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the not already on owner occupied payment agreement of the checks is false.

rule is_eligible_3 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the checks is false.

rule is_eligible_4 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the owner occupant of the checks is false.

rule is_eligible_5 with provenance the model at decision isEligible:
the is_eligible is false if
    the tax delinquent of the checks is false.

scenario Eligible is, as stated in the Bruno requests of PhlOwnerOccupiedPaymentAgreement at test case Eligible:
    the enrollments of the situation are listed.
    the enrollments of the situation include "p1" with "PhlHomesteadExemption".
    the primary person id of the situation is "p1".
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the simple checks of the situation is true.
    the owner occupant of the simple checks of the situation is true.
    the tax delinquent of the simple checks of the situation is true.
    q_d_is_eligible expects answers ["the is_eligible is true"].

scenario Ineligible is, as stated in the Bruno requests of PhlOwnerOccupiedPaymentAgreement at test case Ineligible:
    the enrollments of the situation are listed.
    the enrollments of the situation include "p1" with "PhlOwnerOccupiedPaymentAgreement".
    the primary person id of the situation is "p1".
    the lives in philadelphia pa of the simple checks of the situation is true.
    the owner occupant of the simple checks of the situation is true.
    the tax delinquent of the simple checks of the situation is true.
    q_d_is_eligible expects answers ["the is_eligible is false"].

scenario Next_steps is, as stated in the Bruno requests of PhlOwnerOccupiedPaymentAgreement at test case Next steps:
    q_d_is_eligible expects answers [].

scenario Smoke_Test is, as stated in the Bruno requests of PhlOwnerOccupiedPaymentAgreement at test case Smoke Test:
    the primary person id of the situation is "p1".
    the owner occupant of the simple checks of the situation is true.
    q_d_is_eligible expects answers [].

query q_d_is_eligible is:
    the is_eligible is which truth value.

